{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cadence</strong> breaks the mould by combining <strong>puzzle-solving with music creation</strong>. Whether you're a logic lover, creative explorer, or aspiring musician, Cadence offers multiple ways to enjoy yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Puzzle Mode: Logic Meets Melody</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No musical experience or rhythm required! Use logic and patience to solve increasingly clever puzzles that reward you with beautiful, zen-like melodies. Start simple, working up to mind-bending challenges that'll have you saying &quot;Just one more level...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362800/extras/c32c25308ce3686b5ed76008f28d5978.poster.avif?t=1759248387\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362800/extras/c32c25308ce3686b5ed76008f28d5978.webm?t=1759248387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362800/extras/c32c25308ce3686b5ed76008f28d5978.mp4?t=1759248387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb9 <strong>Sandbox Mode: Make Some Noise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget intimidating DAWs and complex software. Get your first sounds in <strong>seconds</strong>. Whether you're a seasoned composer seeking fresh inspiration or someone who's never touched a music app, Cadence is a safe and fun place to play with music creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362800/extras/2e4298f8b8464ca2b861093418682726.poster.avif?t=1759248387\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362800/extras/2e4298f8b8464ca2b861093418682726.webm?t=1759248387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362800/extras/2e4298f8b8464ca2b861093418682726.mp4?t=1759248387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1<strong>Program the Impossible</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into Cadence's <strong>Turing-complete logic system</strong>. The community has already made things we thought were impossible. What will you build?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362800/extras/b38eca45508305e5035ce9f41d475407.poster.avif?t=1759248387\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362800/extras/b38eca45508305e5035ce9f41d475407.webm?t=1759248387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362800/extras/b38eca45508305e5035ce9f41d475407.mp4?t=1759248387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Community: Many are better than one</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight in-game <strong>Steam Workshop Integration</strong> means:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Best community levels</strong> accessed with one-click play<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udcda <strong>Collaborative learning</strong> from other creators<br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Share your masterpieces</strong> and get recognition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cadence is perfect for:</strong> Puzzle fans, music lovers, creative tinkerers, programming enthusiasts, and anyone seeking a unique gaming experience that grows with you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.s