apps/362800/extras/b38eca45508305e5035ce9f41d475407.mp4?t=1759248387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Community: Many are better than one</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight in-game <strong>Steam Workshop Integration</strong> means:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Best community levels</strong> accessed with one-click play<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udcda <strong>Collaborative learning</strong> from other creators<br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Share your masterpieces</strong> and get recognition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cadence is perfect for:</strong> Puzzle fans, music lovers, creative tinkerers, programming enthusiasts, and anyone seeking a unique gaming experience that grows with you.</p>","developers":["Made With Monster Love"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362800/23d7a5709e147e25127f80d0f63d4a7925b8b4db/header.jpg?t=1759248387","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.6<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Shader Model 2 Graphics Card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 80 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Built-in</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/362800/1041072171/8e7df1c3837d66e9a6c8411270da470a27525d6a/1757497006/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757500006","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/362800/1041072171/8e7df1c3837d66e9